{"stream": "audit", "run_id": "res-0168b546d373", "event": "outbound_call", "ts": 1787741300.4936907, "service": "anthropic", "endpoint": "messages.create", "method": "POST", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 14354.2, "attempt": 1, "error": "", "params": {"model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "max_tokens": 2000, "tool": "web_search_20250305", "max_uses": 5, "prompt_chars": 687, "system_chars": 1496}, "input_tokens": 15220, "output_tokens": 528, "web_search_requests": 2}
{"stream": "audit", "run_id": "res-0168b546d373", "event": "outbound_call", "ts": 1787741303.780462, "service": "mcp", "endpoint": "http://localhost:8080/mcp", "method": "POST", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 3277.0, "attempt": 1, "error": "", "params": {"tool": "upsert_lead_profile", "employee_id": "E00017", "company_id": "C0017", "decision_maker_flag": "Yes", "lead_context": "Axiom Law is directly in the eye of the healthcare AI pilot story. Shared client results across healthcare show that the combination of Legora's purpose-built legal AI and Axiom's AI-enabled legal talent is delivering faster turnarounds and significant cost savings for in-house legal teams managing high-volume work. Most concretely, Axiom deployed an AI-enabled senior lawyer who used Legora to process 344 supplier contracts for a Fortune 10 healthcare company ahead of a product launch, saving the client 70% compared to outside counsel costs. This is a live proof point, not a hypothetical — Axiom has already run and won an AI pilot in healthcare. At the same time, the regulatory environment around healthcare AI is intensifying: there are 177 pending bills in 31 states relating to AI use in healthcare, and Axiom's own 2025 AI study reveals only 20% of legal departments achieve AI maturity despite 33% budget increases, creating dangerous competency gaps. Puliganti, as President, sits at the intersection of Axiom's AI Tech+Talent positioning and the healthcare sector's urgent demand for compliant, proven AI solutions — making the published post's \"successful AI pilot\" theme highly resonant for his growth agenda. A good opening question: *When Axiom pitches AI-enabled legal services to healthcare clients today, what does a successful pilot look like to them — and where does the conversation most often stall?*"}}
